{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈、若月、真夏、私♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか無いメンツなんだけど、\n服装がみんな黒くて\nちょっと面白い(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふいに中3組の昔の写真。\n何空のMVのとき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このいくちゃんがお茶目で可愛い。\nみんな高校生。\nそりゃ若いわけだ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！\nたくさんの質問ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読みながら\n頭の中で答えてた(> <)！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は全部の質問に答えたい...( ;o; )\nごめんね( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも毎週質問コーナーはやるので\n皆さんめげずに質問沢山してください...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ファッションやスニーカーに\n関しての質問にお答えします〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツのサイズは何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→普段はSサイズだよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大きめに着たい時はMやLで、\nたまにメンズのSサイズのTシャツも\n着たりするよ(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツをゆるっと着こなしてると\nオシャレに見える気がする♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はスカート派？パンツ派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→基本パンツが多いかな〜！\nあとほぼほぼ、ロング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも少し大人っぽくキメたいときは\nロングスカートで上品に♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りのスニーカーはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→あんまり数は持ってないから\n注目してるものを挙げると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NIKEのAir max90や\nadidasのスタンスミス、\nReebokのポンプフューリーに\nついつい目がいってしまう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はスニーカーは結構シンプルなのを\n選びがちだから、\n少し派手なのもこれからみてみようかな〜\nと思っているよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョーカーはどんなのがいいとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→チョーカーなら何でも好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太いレースも付けるし、\n細い紐みたいなのも付ける♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒いチョーカーが私的に、\n1番合わせやすくて使いやすいんだけど\n最近は黒以外の茶色やピンクのも\n欲しいな〜と思ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NIKE ID で作ろうと思うんだけど何がいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→いいな〜羨ましい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤とか派手な色で他の人とは\n少し違った目立つのもいいと思うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒やグレー、白をベースに\n一見普通のかと思えばよく見たら\nみんなのとは一味違う感じのもいいと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくだから\n誰も持ってなさそうのがいいよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、今日はこんな感じでした(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の質問もスクショしてあるから\n次の質問の中とかに混ぜるかも♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん質問ありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/19/3928282/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今日もチョーカー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装さんに可愛い！と褒められ\n嬉しくなりました( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の好きなものを、\n人に好きと言ってもらえると\nとっても嬉しいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ワタリドリ」【Alexandros】さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イントロがもう、好き。\n2番の歌詞がいいなーと思います。\nサビの高音も心に響いてくる！\nライブで聞いたら凄い元気になりそう。\n飛び跳ねながら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントみてると皆さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その曲いいよね！\nと共感してくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲も聴いてみて！\nとオススメしてくださっていて\n凄い嬉しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこれからもオススメ教えてね〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もテスト(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろ(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}